WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.110
So...

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:15.820
III, does that mean you wish to meet Yuma Tsukumo?

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.400
That's right. During that duel, we didn't lose to Kaito...

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.340
We lost to the strength of Yuma Tuskumo.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.600
Just how can he manage to duel like that?

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.790
Just what is his power?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.170
I want to confirm it with my own eyes.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.740
That's fine, III.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:38.910
Tron...

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:42.540
If you wish to do that, why not just meet him in person?

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:03.750
Isn't there anyone around to duel with me?

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.160
I'm begging you!

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:07.550
No?

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.390
Hey! You want to?

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:12.280
Nope.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.630
Hmph. Then what about you? I mean YOU!

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.290
Aaoch! That hurts!

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.920
Alright, Yuma! Just calm yourself!

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.030
I know, but...

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.050
But I don't have enough Heart Pieces yet...

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:30.900
The preliminaries will be over today, you know.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:33.500
Ah! If I don't hurry...

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.360
Wait, Yuma!

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.210
Wait! Geez...

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:40.920
Duel, duel!

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:43.310
Calm down, Yuma!

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.670
It's only natural for a duelist to want to duel.

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:48.800
This isn't the time to be saying that!

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.980
Hey! Are you alright? Hey!

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.300
Just what on earth is going on?

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:03.400
Shark...that Shark guy...

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:07.450
This is...

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:08.880
Horrible...

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:10.870
Don't tell me it's Shark!

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:42.640
Shark...

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.930
Hey, Shark! What on earth are you doing?

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:58.350
Hey! Wait... what's happening to you?

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:02.480
I'm simply going to continue fighting my way through the Duel Carnival.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:03.780
You...?!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.310
My only motivation right now is...
 a heart full of revenge and hatred.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:11.490
Shark...

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:13.980
Remember this, Yuma.

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:16.760
You are my foe as well.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.480
Shark...

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:27.990
Wait! Shark!

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:29.260
Move!

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.350
No, I won't move!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.000
You bastard...

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:39.410
If you have to go past me, Shark, you'll have to duel me!

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:41.870
A duel, you say?

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.810
Yes, that's right.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.860
Let's finish this here and now!

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.400
Interesting...

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:51.160
In that case, I'll rip you to shreds with my own two hands!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.080
Come, Shark!

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.900
Yuma, you shouldn't fight him carelessly!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.590
Shut up! Just be silent!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.960
Duel Disk, set!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:14.270
D-Gazer, set!

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:21.230
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:23.910
Duel!!

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.060
Yuma is dueling with Shark?

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:33.800
During the duel before, his Number left a shred inside Shark's heart.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:36.760
Shark's heart was contaminated by hatred.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:42.250
Yuma, show me just how you plan to duel him.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.350
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:49.400
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:56.660
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:05.920
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:10.420
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:16.880
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:21.680
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:27.350
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:32.610
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:35.490
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:38.780
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:43.950
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.540
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.710
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:55.260
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:57.760
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.760
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:07.560
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.390
Go, Big Jaws! Attack Gagaga Magician!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.860
Number 46: Fighting For His Family:
 The Gentle Avenger, III"

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.730
Big Mouth!

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.860
Gagaga!

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:27.530
Then Attack directly! Go, Hammer Shark!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.360
Trap card, open!

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.370
Tiny Resistance!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:36.500
This card lowers the ATK of my opponent's monster equal

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:41.670
to the ATK of one LV4 or lower monster with 1000 or lower ATK which rests in my graveyard!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.140
This attack... is nothing!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.600
Oh? Then what about this guy?

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:02.900
I overlay the LV3 Big Jaws and Hammer Shark!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.190
I build the Overlay Network with these 2 monsters!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.030
Xyz Summon!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:12.950
Come forth, Submersible Carrier Aero Shark!

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:16.040
I activate Aero Shark's effect!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:20.210
For every card in my hand it inflicts 400 points of damage to my opponent!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:24.880
There are 3 cards in my hand! Take this! Air Torpedo!

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:29.880
Yuma!

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.840
Do you understand now, Yuma? Don't get involved with me...

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.520
Not yet... This isn't over yet...

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:43.100
Get more serious, Shark!

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.190
You bastard!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.150
If you don't come at me, I will!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.650
My turn, draw!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.360
I summon Gogogo Giant!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.460
I will end my turn like this.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:03.420
What?!!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:04.750
Why?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.210
Why, Yuma?

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:11.010
You could have destroyed his monster if you attacked with Gogogo Giant!

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.430
Just what are you thinking?

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:17.010
It's alright, that's how I duel!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.560
Yuma, you...!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.600
What is with this duel...?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.060
It was the same last time!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:30.900
You duel differently than us, who duel for revenge.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:32.820
But I...

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.320
Yuma, why would you duel like that?

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.330
Is it really all right to let III go?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:46.500
Yuma Tsukumo has a different power than ours.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.000
When meeting him, III's heart might be shaken.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.220
It's fine. III is a kind child.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:55.890
Kind?

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:00.640
Yes... which is why III will definitely come back.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.810
That's the kind of kid he is.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:08.270
Show yourself! Black Ray Lancer!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.530
It's bad! Yuma!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:21.330
Go, Black Ray Lancer!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:26.040
Attack Gogogo Giant! Black Spear!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.050
Sorry, Gogogo Giant!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.640
Then I attack you directly with Aero Shark!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.850
Take this! Big Eater!

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:55.900
Yuma!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.870
Why are you playing to lose?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:13.500
Not enough... It's not over yet, Shark!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:19.760
Alright, come, let me take a look at your true strength!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.180
Yuma... Don't tell me you...

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.390
Yes... that's right.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.770
This duel...I...

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.940
I don't care about winning or losing!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:35.860
Yuma...

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:40.320
Shark! Don't you hate me?

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.030
Then hit me with all of that hatred!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.250
Come at me with all your might!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.580
If that way can make your hatred disappear, then so be it!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:57.210
You little...
Because of hatred, because of revenge...do you feel happy that way?!

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.890
Aren't you just a guy who just loves dueling?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.350
But now, don't you hate dueling as well?

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.390
Seeing you act like that... I...

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:12.520
I don't want to see that!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.540
Geez, what are you doing?

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:36.300
I- it can't be helped! I'm hungry!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.550
Goodness... You're such a man.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:43.050
What's wrong with that? That's why I am saying it can't be helped!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.470
It made a sound by itself!

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.760
You don't have any delicacy at all!

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.720
What do you mean by delivery?!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.600
You still don't get what I'm saying?

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:54.730
The power of the Numbers... has disappeared from Shark's heart!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.980
Geez, you are such a fool!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.490
What?!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:01.570
I quit!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.110
So idiotic!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.750
Wait, Shark, wait! Hey!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.960
Seeing an idiot like you, I'm losing my drive.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.090
What do you mean 'idiot'?

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.840
Let's resume this duel during the Finals.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.230
Hold it, Yuma!

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:32.100
That hurts!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.100
What's wrong, Kotori?

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.520
What about the finals now?

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.230
If you happened to lose to Shark, wouldn't you have lost all of your heart pieces?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.950
Huh? That..that's right!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.450
I completely forgot that!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.780
I won't criticize you for taking care of your friends,

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:54.460
but if you happened to lose that one, both the Numbers and my life would have disappeared.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:02.260
Sorry! Everything is out of my whim and made me forgot about Numbers and such!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.470
Isn't that your promise with your father?

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.010
'I will definitely become Duel Champion!'

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:12.270
No...but...even my own father, at that circumstance...

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.190
He would definitely stop that with all of his might!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.270
Therefore, I think he will definitely forgive me!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.230
For goodness sakes...

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.150
Yuma's father...?

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.080
So this person is Yuma's father.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:48.840
This is...

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.640
Oh you...

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.730
Oh, um... I...

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.060
Excuse me... who can...

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.940
Duel with me...?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.740
Grandma... what's wrong?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.460
Hey you, what are you doing...?!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.590
Yuma, awesome - Awesome!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.590
This is a mask from the Aztecs!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.850
Those are stone tools from 2,000 years ago!

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.100
That's the iron arrow heads made in Hittite.

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:37.770
Wow, a necklace from the Inca!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.480
All of them are great no matter how you look at them!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.360
Just like my favorite card.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:44.900
Look!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.070
Aztec Mask Golem...

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:50.610
That's right.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.910
The deck I am using using is called OOParts.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.580
OOParts are evidence of a connection between this world and different dimension!

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.460
In this world there are multiple dimensions overlapping each other!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.920
And some people believe that OOParts come from there.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.220
My father was devoting his studies toward this direction!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:13.140
Ohhh! And my dad is an adventurer!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.140
Everything here belongs to my dad!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:20.310
Is that so? Your father must be a great person!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.440
Ah...I guess...

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:26.690
This isn't the time to be talking about this!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.990
Because of you guys, Haruto...

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:29.650
Sorry!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:30.900
Huh?

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.410
I apologize about Haruto!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.030
III...

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.160
But...that's the only thing I can do.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.040
You...

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.670
Yuma, for revenge...

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.630
I fought until now relying on the power of hatred.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.880
But after watching your duel,

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:55.300
I think a power besides hatred might exist as well.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:56.680
Huh?

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.980
How can you got so worked up for others?

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.940
Just what is your power?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.610
My...power?!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:07.940
That's right.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.150
I am different from you.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.200
How can you fight like that?

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.910
My power... my...

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.660
I wouldn't know something that complicated!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:22.410
Huh?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.880
Anyway, it's called 'Bring it!'... 'Bring it to 'Em'!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.050
'Bring it to 'Em'...

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:34.130
Yeah... A belief of never giving up regardless of the circumstances, and never forgetting to challenge yourself!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.180
That's what my dad has taught me!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.060
Your father...

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.480
Hey, Yuma! Lunch is ready!

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.270
Sis!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.400
Kotori-<i>chan</i> and others can join us too.

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.190
I'm hungry!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.490
Yuma! You should say <i>'Itadakimasu'</i> first!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.910
I... I know.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.160
That is good.

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.330
Geez, you act like that every single time!

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:03.540
Hmph!

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.670
Whoa! It looks delicious!

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.420
Okay, you over there. Have a seat.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.500
Ye.. yes.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.220
<i>Itadakimasu</i>!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.090
<i>Itadakimasu</i>!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:21.680
Whoa! This Duel Supper is great! One more!

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:25.850
Um...

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.440
Say '<i>Itadakimasu</i>' first...

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.190
<i>Itadakimasu</i>...

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:37.610
Tea...Tea...Tea is ready!

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.780
Here. You suck.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.040
I do not suck!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.750
Shut up. You suck.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.540
So hot!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.290
Why do you suck so bad?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.300
D-Don't you laugh!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.300
Enough, Yuma, just eat quietly!

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.840
I know that!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:02.600
But if I don't eat quickly and start to duel...

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.140
Talking about cards during meal time is forbidden!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.190
No way!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.900
Give my cards back, Sis!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.400
No!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.730
Just give them back!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:13.980
I told you I won't!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.750
<i>Right, look, look Big Brother!</i>

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.290
<i>Aztec Mask Golem!</i>

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.460
<i>Father gave it to me!</i>

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:35.130
<i>It's not fair that only you got one! Give it!</i>

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:39.510
<i>C'mon! Give it back, Big Brother!</i>

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.470
<i>No!</i>

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.800
<i>C'mon, Big Brother!</i>

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.010
<i>Then come get it!</i>

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:45.520
<i>Geez!</i>

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.850
<i>He gave it to me!</i>

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.270
<i>Stop, you two!</i>

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.310
<i>You will get scolded when father gets back.</i>

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.690
<i>Tch, I know!</i>

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:55.070
<i>Yes...</i>

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.700
<i>Give it back, Big Brother.</i>

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.160
<i>Here.</i>

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.790
<i>Be good boys and I will teach you how to duel next time.</i>

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.040
<i>Wow...</i>

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:07.910
<i>Really?</i>

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:09.250
<i>Sure!</i>

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.250
<i>Big Brother...</i>

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:18.010
I'm so close to five! I'm definitely gonna get 'em!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.800
Can you really become Duel Champion?

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:24.260
<i>Right. My family was once like that too.</i>

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.140
I will! It'll be a breeze!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.430
Don't get full of yourself.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:28.770
III?

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:30.890
What's the matter?

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:41.360
You...

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.330
I'm sorry. Please excuse me!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.420
Hey, III!

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:58.590
Wait, III!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:02.880
Yuma, I finally understand after seeing your family.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.430
Your power, your 'Bring it to 'Em'...

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.230
It is the power to protect the smiles of your family and friends!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:15.610
But..I...my family is different from yours!

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.490
From the moment we sworn to battle for revenge,

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.860
the smile on my family's faces vanished!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:28.410
But...when the revenge is over, everyone will definitely smile again!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:33.960
But, Yuma! As long as you exist, our revenge will never happen!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.210
Thus for my family,

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.210
I have to defeat you!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:44.050
Why? Why did it turn out this way?

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:45.760
The same goes for Haruto!

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.100
That's our family's decision!

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:49.600
III!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.430
I don't have any emotion other than hatred!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.690
You're lying!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:55.980
Yuma!

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.690
Tonight, I will be waiting for you over there!

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.030
It's a map.

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:10.240
What?

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.540
Let's finish this once and for all!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:16.330
III!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:24.420
III...

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.260
Welcome back, III.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.810
Tron... I...

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:38.270
You don't need to say anything. I know.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.610
You desire power, right? In order to defeat him?

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:44.610
Yes!

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:51.370
Yuma, he is very powerful!

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.620
Are you really going?

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.620
I know... but I...

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:58.830
...want to talk more with him.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:02.000
I want to know his real feelings.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:08.680
That's why I will duel with him.

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:23.280
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:29.160
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:38.160
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:41.750
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:45.840
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:48.630
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:49.180 --> 00:22:53.100
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:56.140
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:59.440
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:06.530
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:09.570
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.950
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:17.790
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:23.170
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:26.210
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.800
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:34.220
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:36.060
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:38.350
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:44.810
During the preliminary of the Duel Carnival, the final battle with III has started.

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:48.530
Be careful, he is different than before.

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:52.530
He is a friend I once dueled with, so I will learn everything about him!

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:54.530
Don't get engulfed by the power of Evil!

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:59.330
Just....what on earth am I doing?
 Why would I duel like that?

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:02.170
Next, time in Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal:

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:05.130
Yuma Gives Up!? The Stolen "Bring It To 'Em!"

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:08.300
Yuma, don't tell me you...

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.930
The monster we introduce this time is String Devil Muzumuzu Rhythm!

00:24:13.930 --> 00:24:17.510
When this Xyz monster battles, you can double its ATK.

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:20.430
That icky rhythm makes me feel itchy!
 <i>(Muzumuzu = "Creepy", "Itchy")</i>

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:22.690
This caper was a lot of work, my dear Watson. 
 <i>(Gekimu = hard work)</i>

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:23.730
That's Holmes!
